// Hand-written 12-1 content: entities, theme (parallax set, lit tiles), set dressing and the level script. design/levels/level_12_1.py appends this file to the
// generated data. Art comes from design/sprites/w12_set.py (the real On Cinema Oscar Special set: painted sky, skyline, plywood hills, white director's
